id: combat-blueprint-first-effect
name: Combat Blueprint
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: combat-blueprint
fromEffect: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Combat Blueprint's first effect, as a Maneuver: during your turn, Power stacks spent - 2(bT) Life and Ki each; 2+, an Adaptation Point.
text: >
  (1)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver during your turn, you may spend any number of Power stacks. For each spent Power stack, regain 2(bT) Life and Ki Points. If you spend 2+ stacks through this effect, gain an Adaptation Point.

---

# Only during your turn, and with a Power stack to spend - both asked before the use is counted (use-maneuver.mjs). How many, asked; 2(bT)
# Life and Ki Points each; 2 or more, an Adaptation Point (chat.mjs blueprintPower).
[on used]
blueprintPower();
